ify; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.7; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">摘要：</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: 8px; align-self: stretch; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; background-color: rgb(221, 197, 138); margin: 0px 0px 0px 6px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left; line-height: 0; width: 0px; vertical-align: top; visibility: visible;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 100 100 0%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left; line-height: 0; width: 0px; vertical-align: top; visibility: visible;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(221, 197, 138); line-height: 1.5; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 8px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; align-self: flex-start; flex: 100 100 0%; height: auto; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 197, 138); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(221, 197, 138); padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">《最高人民法院关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（二）》（以下简称“司法解释二”）自2025年9月1日起施行，其中部分条款对餐饮企业产生了深远影响。本文从律师角度出发，对司法解释二中第十九条、第六条、第二十一条等重点条款进行深入解读，并分析这些条款对餐饮企业的具体影响，旨在为餐饮企业提供法律指引，帮助其更好地应对法律风险，实现合规经营。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: 44px; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; margin: 0px 0px 0px -44px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 0; margin: 0px 0px -4px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qPS58ek1kKIDJ3wQ635nEFLp5qsbVq6vM2AGY3MW3R9LX5tfzdj0Rn6SxJ6sKRcTTkedmYiaibTS2aj9Ijhqkltw/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.22033898305084745\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"118\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 44px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"4\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qPS58ek1kKIDJ3wQ635nEFLp5qsbVq6vM2AGY3MW3R9LX5tfzdj0Rn6SxJ6sKRcTTkedmYiaibTS2aj9Ijhqkltw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"1\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246); border-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(189, 50, 32); min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 3px 8px; border-top-left-radius: 7px; border-bottom-right-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; margin: 0px; border-bottom-left-radius: 7px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">一</span></b></p></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; line-height: 0; align-self: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px); transform-style: flat; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 0px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; border-style: solid; border-width: 5px 7px 0px 0px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(189, 50, 32) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; align-self: center; padding: 0px 13px 0px 5px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">引言</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">餐饮行业作为典型的劳动密集型行业，面临着复杂的劳动用工问题。从员工招聘、合同签订到社会保险缴纳等环节，都可能涉及法律风险。司法解释二的实施，对餐饮行业的劳动用工管理提出了新的要求和挑战。特别是其中的第十九条（社会保险缴纳问题）、第六条（未签订劳动合同的二倍工资问题）和第二十一条（超龄用工法律关系的调整），这三个条款直接触及餐饮企业在日常运营中最常见的劳动用工场景，对企业的成本控制、法律风险防范以及人力资源管理等方面产生了重大影响。因此，深入解读这三个条款，对于餐饮企业理解和应对司法解释二带来的变化至关重要。本文将重点解读上述条款，并分析其对餐饮企业的影响，为餐饮企业提供法律建议，助力企业合规经营。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 30px 0px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246); border-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(189, 50, 32); min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 3px 8px; border-top-left-radius: 7px; border-bottom-right-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; margin: 0px; border-bottom-left-radius: 7px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">二</span></b></p></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; line-height: 0; align-self: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px); transform-style: flat; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 0px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; border-style: solid; border-width: 5px 7px 0px 0px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(189, 50, 32) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; align-self: center; padding: 0px 13px 0px 5px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">司法解释二重点条款解读</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（一）第十九条：社会保险缴纳问题</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(189, 50, 32);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">条款内容：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">用人单位与劳动者约定或者劳动者向用人单位承诺无需缴纳社会保险费的，人民法院应认定该约定或承诺无效。用人单位未依法缴纳社会保险费，劳动者根据劳动合同法第三十八条第三项规定请求解除劳动合同、由用人单位支付经济补偿的，人民法院依法予以支持。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 4, 8);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">背景：</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">法律体系的完善与统一</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">：</span></span><span leaf=\"\">早在1995年施行的《劳动法》以及2011年施行的《社会保险法》中，就已明确规定用人单位和劳动者必须依法参加社会保险，缴纳社会保险费。然而，在实际操作中，各地司法裁判对于劳动者与用人单位签订的“放弃社保协议（或声明）”的法律效力存在不同观点，导致同案不同判的现象时有发生。司法解释二第十九条的出台，正是为了统一裁判标准，明确此类协议或承诺的无效性，进一步完善劳动法律体系，确保司法实践中的公平与公正。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">应对劳动力人口变化</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">：</span></span><span leaf=\"\">我国的劳动力人口在2015年达到峰值后，呈现逐年减少的趋势。在此背景下，国家推出了延迟退休年龄政策、鼓励超龄劳动者继续就业等措施来应对劳动力人口减少的问题。而依法缴纳社会保险，对于保障超龄劳动者的基本权益，以及维护整个社会的养老保障体系的可持续性具有重要意义。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">社保征缴力度的加强</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">：</span></span><span leaf=\"\">近年来，社保征缴力度不断加大，这种背景下，司法解释二第十九条的出台，与社保征缴政策的加强相呼应，进一步强化了用人单位和劳动者依法缴纳社会保险的义务，有助于推动社保制度的全面实施和有效运行。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 4, 8);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">趋势：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">劳动者权益保障的强化</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：该条款赋予了劳动者一种法定的“反悔权”，即便劳动者曾主动要求不参加社保，事后仍可依据此条款要求用人单位缴纳社保，并以此为由解除合同拿到经济补偿。这表明劳动者权益保障在不断强化，劳动者在劳动关系中的地位得到了进一步提升。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">用人单位合规要求的提高</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：司法解释二第十九条的实施，意味着用人单位在劳动用工管理中，必须严格遵守社会保险缴纳的法律规定，不能再通过与劳动者签订协议或接受劳动者承诺的方式规避社保缴纳义务。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">司法裁判标准的统一</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：此前，对于劳动者与用人单位签订的“放弃社保的协议（或声明）”的法律效力，各地司法裁判存在分歧。司法解释二第十九条明确了此类协议或承诺无效，并规定了劳动者可据此解除劳动合同并要求经济补偿的裁判标准。这将促使全国范围内的司法裁判标准趋于统一，减少因地区差异导致的裁判不一致现象，提高司法公信力和权威性。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(189, 50, 32);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">律师解读：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">社会保险是劳动法规定的用人单位和劳动者的法定义务，旨在保障劳动者的合法权益。然而，在实际用工过程中，部分用人单位与劳动者之间可能存在关于不缴纳社会保险的约定或承诺，这种做法在司法解释二实施后被明确否定。该条款强调了社会保险的强制性，无论双方是否有约定或承诺，用人单位都具有为劳动者缴纳社会保险的法定义务。否则，劳动者有权依据劳动合同法第三十八条第三项规定解除劳动合同，并要求用人单位支付经济补偿。这一规定旨在保护劳动者的合法权益，确保其在失业、医疗、养老等方面能够得到基本保障，同时也促使用人单位依法履行社会保险缴纳义务，维护劳动关系的和谐稳定。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（二）第六条：未签订劳动合同的二倍工资问题</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(189, 50, 32);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">条款内容：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">用人单位自用工之日起超过一个月不满一年未与劳动者订立书面劳动合同的，应当依照劳动合同法第八十二条的规定向劳动者支付二倍工资。但劳动者故意拖延或者拒绝签订劳动合同的除外。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 4, 8);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">律师解读：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">劳动合同是明确用人单位与劳动者之间权利义务关系的重要法律文件，对于维护双方的合法权益具有重要意义。劳动合同法第八十二条规定了用人单位未与劳动者签订书面劳动合同的法律责任，即用人单位需向劳动者支付二倍工资。这一规定旨在督促用人单位及时与劳动者签订书面劳动合同，规范劳动用工管理。然而，在实践中，可能存在劳动者故意拖延或拒绝签订劳动合同的情况，这使得用人单位在履行签订劳动合同义务时面临一定的困难。司法解释二第六条对此进行了明确，规定在这种情况下用人单位可以免责。这一规定平衡了用人单位与劳动者之间的利益关系，既保障了劳动者的合法权益，又避免了用人单位因劳动者故意行为而承担不合理的法律责任，有助于促进劳动关系的和谐稳定发展。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（三）第二十一条：超龄用工法律关系的调整</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(189, 50, 32);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">条款内容：</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本解释自2025年9月1日起施行。《最高人民法院关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）》第三十二条第一款同时废止。而司法解释一第三十二条第一款的内容是：“用人单位与其招用的已经依法享受养老保险待遇或者领取退休金的人员发生用工争议而提起诉讼的，人民法院应当按劳务关系处理。”</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(189, 50, 32);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">律师解读：</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">随着人口老龄化的加剧，超龄人员就业现象日益增多。在司法解释一第三十二条第一款被废止之前，用人单位招用已经依法享受养老保险待遇或者领取退休金的人员，双方之间的用工关系明确按劳务关系处理。这种规定在一定程度上简化了用人单位的用工管理，降低了法律风险。然而，司法解释二第二十一条的实施，使得超龄用工人员提起诉讼时，不再一定按劳务关系处理，有可能按劳动关系处理。这一变化意味着用人单位在招用超龄人员时，需要重新审视双方的法律关系，准确判断用工性质，以避免因法律关系认定错误而引发的劳动争议和法律责任。用人单位需关注超龄人员的就业权益保障，同时也要依法规范用工行为，确保双方的合法权益得到充分保护。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 30px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);border-radius: 7px;overflow: hidden;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(189, 50, 32);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 3px 8px;border-top-left-radius: 7px;border-bottom-right-radius: 7px;overflow: hidden;margin: 0px;border-bottom-left-radius: 7px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 4px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">三</span></b></p></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 0 0 0%;height: auto;line-height: 0;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);-webkit-transform: perspective(0px);-moz-transform: perspective(0px);-o-transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-webkit-transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-moz-transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-o-transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 0px;height: 0px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 5px 7px 0px 0px;border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(189, 50, 32) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: center;padding: 0px 13px 0px 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">对餐饮企业的影响</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 60px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（一）成本增加</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">社会保险缴纳成本</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：根据第十九条，餐饮企业必须依法为员工缴纳社会保险费，这将直接增加企业的人力成本。餐饮行业员工流动性大，企业需要投入更多的时间和精力进行社保缴纳管理，确保每位员工都能按时足额缴纳社保，这无疑增加了企业的运营成本和管理难度。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">超龄用工成本</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：第二十一条实施后，餐饮企业在招用超龄人员时，需考虑可能按劳动关系处理的法律风险。如果超龄人员与企业之间的用工关系被认定为劳动关系，企业可能需要承担更多的用工成本，如用工关系中的休息休假、工伤待遇、最低工资标准、加班工资等基本的权益保障，可能会比照劳动关系处理。这将直接影响企业的利润空间，增加企业的经营成本。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（二）法律风险上升</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">社会保险缴纳风险</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：第十九条明确规定，用人单位与劳动者关于不缴纳社会保险的约定或承诺无效。餐饮企业若未依法缴纳社会保险费，劳动者有权解除劳动合同并要求支付经济补偿。这使得企业在社会保险缴纳方面面临更高的法律风险，一旦发生劳动争议，企业可能需承担不利的法律后果，如支付经济补偿金、滞纳金等，甚至可能面临行政处罚。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">超龄用工法律风险</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：第二十一条实施后，餐饮企业在超龄用工方面面临更大的法律风险。超龄人员与企业之间的法律关系不再明确，可能按照“特殊劳动关系处理”，这使得企业在招用超龄人员时，可能需按照“劳动关系”支付加班工资、经济补偿金等。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（三）管理要求提高</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">劳动合同管理</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：第六条要求餐饮企业加强劳动合同签订管理，确保在员工入职一个月内签订书面劳动合同。企业需建立健全劳动合同管理制度，明确合同签订流程和责任，加强合同签订监督和检查，确保每位员工都能及时签订书面劳动合同。同时，企业还需关注合同签订过程中的法律风险，如合同条款的合法性、合同签订的自愿性等，避免因合同签订问题引发的劳动争议。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">社会保险管理</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：第十九条强调了用人单位依法缴纳社会保险的义务。餐饮企业需加强社会保险缴纳管理，建立健全社保缴纳制度，明确社保缴纳流程和责任。此外，企业还需关注社保缴纳过程中的法律风险，如社保缴纳基数的准确性、社保缴纳时间的及时性等，避免因社保缴纳问题引发的劳动争议和法律责任。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">超龄用工管理</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：第二十一条实施后，餐饮企业在超龄用工方面需加强管理。企业需重新审视超龄人员的用工性质，准确判断双方的法律关系，依法规范用工行为。企业还需关注超龄人员的就业权益保障，如工作时间、休息休假、劳动报酬等，确保超龄人员的合法权益得到充分保护。同时，企业需建立健全超龄用工管理制度，明确超龄人员的用工条件、用工流程和责任，加强超龄用工监督和检查，避免因超龄用工引发的劳动争议和法律责任。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;isolation: isolate;transform: translate3d(25px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(25px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(25px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(25px, 0px, 0px);margin: 30px 0px -30px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 90%;height: 60px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(189, 50, 32) 20%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;justify-content: flex-start;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1;text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">笔者介绍</span></strong></span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 226, 46);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: flex-end;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 15px;padding: 0px 10px;text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;transform: translate3d(60px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(60px, 0px,